<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="demo-banner">演示邀请 · 仅在本机体验加入流程</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在查看旅行邀请…</view><view wx:if="{{invite}}" class="card join"><view class="join-icon">⌁</view><view class="eyebrow">好朋友，一起出发</view><view class="heading">加入「{{invite.name}}」</view><view class="subtitle">{{invite.destination}}</view><view class="join-detail">确认加入后，你可以查看、录入和管理这次旅行的支出与还款。加入前不会展示账单。</view><button class="button primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="join">确认加入旅行</button><view class="help">也使用网页版？请先绑定账号，避免以两个身份加入。</view><button class="button ghost" bindtap="account">前往我的账号</button></view></view>
